  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC C Bio ethanol production</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC C Bioetanol produktion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akt&#xf6;rsamverkansprojekt mellan Food Industries Research Institute (FIRI) under MOIT Vietnam och Chalmers Tekniska H&#xf6;gskola, Dept of Chemical and Biological Engineering. Parterna samarbetar f&#xf6;r att uppt&#xe4;cka nya enzymer. Deras fokus ligger p&#xe5; att finna ett enzym som kan utveckla en ny teknik f&#xf6;r produktion av bioetanol fr&#xe5;n jordbruksavfall.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a PDC Cooperation Project between Food Industries Research Institute under MOIT of Vietnam and Chalmers University of Technology, Dept of Chemical and Biological Engineering, Sweden. They collaborate in enzyme discovering and engineering. Their focus is on lignocellulytic enzyme discovery, it could be possible to develop a new technique to produce bio-ethanol from agricultural waste.</narrative>
  </description>
